publish_film: description, inputSchema  -and -one). +one), and the creator's rights confirmation. The first time a film is published the user must agree to this statement, which you read to them in full before passing confirm_rights: true: "I confirm I own or hold every right needed to publish and sell this film, including music, footage, performances and releases from people in it. I accept full responsibility for any claim that it infringes someone's rights, as set out in the Terms of Service – Your warranties (/terms#your-warranties)." A film that already carries a confirmation is not asked again. +publish_film with confirm_right  parameters: +input.confirm_rights input.confirm_rights description: The creator's rights confirmation, required the first time a film is published (not asked again once recorded). Pass true only after the user has agreed to this statement, read to them in full: "I confirm I own or hold every right needed to publish and sell this film, including music, footage, performances and releases from people in it. I accept full responsibility for any claim that it infringes someone's rights, as set out in the Terms of Service – Your warranties (/terms#your-warranties)."
update_film: description, inputSchema  -links), +links, the AI disclosure mostly_ai_generated shown as 'Made with AI' on the film page),  parameters: +input.mostly_ai_generated input.mostly_ai_generated description: AI disclosure: true when "The majority of this film is AI-generated". Shown to viewers as 'Made with AI' on your film page.
update_project: inputSchema  parameters: -like; +like. Markdown is accepted: **bold**, *italic*, ## and ### headings, [text](https://url) links, and lists starting with - or 1.; raw HTML is shown as text;

create_enquiry: description  -Consultancy (the +Consultancy, which acts as introducer only (it does not sell or -of record and licensed advisor). +property).
get_property: description  -is broker of record; +acts as introducer only;
search_properties: description  -is +acts as introducer only (it does not sell or -of record on every listing — +property); -contact; +contact, and

